{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118824","id":3564422127,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7UdMPv","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118824","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118824/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118824/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118824/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f63ab5fbd91cd0fb9a154ae8c2e51f9276a891a2","number":118824,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix a race in `ResourceLoader::load_threaded_request()`","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When multiple threads try to load the same sub-resource the ResourceLoader's anti-deadlock protection thinks that the other threads loading the dependency are old threads blocked on a dependency.\r\n\r\nThe current thread will then immediately start to load the sub-resource since they can't wait for it. This can then lead to multiple threads loading the same resource concurrently.\r\n\r\nWe fix the problem by recording in the task when loading has ACTUALLY started, and if so we simply wait.\r\n\r\nThis is no worse than before, at the point where we are waiting now we previously re-started the load entirely.\r\n\r\nTested by running the MRP from the below issue (with and without asan and msan), and loading and running various public and private Godot projects.\r\n\r\nThis also fixes a use-after-free on resource_changed_connections when multiple threads end up running the same import. This is a pre-existing bug but this code widened the race window.\r\n\r\nThis also fixes a pre-existing memory leak in load_threaded_request, when the user calls the function we capture the Ref<LoadToken> but immediately drop the ref. Causing the refcount to go to 1. Later in _run_load_task we unreference manually, bringing the refcount to 0. This then later prevents the Ref<> from memdeleting the LoadToken.\r\n\r\nThis fixes #118085\r\nThis fixes #118185\r\nThis fixes #111202\r\nThis fixes #115069\r\n\r\nBefore and after benchmarks:\r\n\r\nMaster: \r\n```\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back0.tscn: 25595 us (25.59 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back1.tscn: 25656 us (25.66 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back2.tscn: 25963 us (25.96 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back3.tscn: 25980 us (25.98 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back4.tscn: 25992 us (25.99 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back5.tscn: 26004 us (26.00 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back6.tscn: 26013 us (26.01 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back7.tscn: 25997 us (26.00 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back8.tscn: 26001 us (26.00 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back9.tscn: 26012 us (26.01 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back10.tscn: 26015 us (26.02 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back11.tscn: 26023 us (26.02 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back12.tscn: 26031 us (26.03 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back13.tscn: 26032 us (26.03 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back14.tscn: 26045 us (26.05 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back15.tscn: 26054 us (26.05 ms)\r\n```\r\nThis PR:\r\n```\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back0.tscn: 58 us (0.06 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back1.tscn: 104 us (0.10 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back2.tscn: 125 us (0.12 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back3.tscn: 146 us (0.15 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back4.tscn: 164 us (0.16 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back5.tscn: 182 us (0.18 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back6.tscn: 196 us (0.20 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back7.tscn: 209 us (0.21 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back8.tscn: 222 us (0.22 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back9.tscn: 235 us (0.23 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back10.tscn: 247 us (0.25 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back11.tscn: 259 us (0.26 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back12.tscn: 270 us (0.27 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back13.tscn: 282 us (0.28 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back14.tscn: 276 us (0.28 ms)\r\nres://visual_shader/decimillipede_segment_back15.tscn: 287 us (0.29 ms)\r\n```\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_a